<title>BELGIUM: GBL, ELECTRAFINA 96 RESULTS DUE TUESDAY, WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>GBL, ELECTRAFINA 96 RESULTS DUE TUESDAY, WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Groupe Bruxelles Lambert SA should release 1996 results on Tuesday following a board meeting, a spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>GBL's Electrafina unit would likely release 1996 results on Wednesday, he said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
